OL,3,GNEWSADrug deaths rise sharply in
OL,4,AScotland as figures remain worst in
OL,5,AEurope
OL,6,
OL,7,FDeaths related to illicit drugs rose by
OL,8,F11% in Scotland last year to 1,133 as
OL,9,Fthe country struggles to tackle the
OL,10,Fworst fatality rate in Europe.
OL,12,FNational Records of Scotland (NRS) said
OL,13,Fthe figure for 2025 was 116 higher than
OL,14,Fthe previous year, bringing the total
OL,15,Fdeaths in a decade to more than 11,000.
OL,17,FAfter adjusting for age, there were
OL,18,F21.4 drug-related deaths per million
OL,19,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
