OL,3,GNEWSADrug deaths rise sharply in
OL,4,AScotland as figures remain worst in
OL,5,AEurope
OL,6,
OL,7,FNRS defines drug-related deaths as
OL,8,Fthose where the underlying cause was
OL,9,Fdrug poisoning, a controlled substance
OL,10,Fwas in the body at the time of death,
OL,11,Fand drug use led directly to the death.
